		{"id":"1e41a55ea6a19cd3","x":-620,"y":280,"width":732,"height":610,"type":"text","text":"CONTEXT: NFL TEAM FINANCIAL DATA - CHART OF ACCOUNTS STRUCTURE\n\n## Account Number System\n- 1xxx = Assets (Balance Sheet)\n- 2xxx = Liabilities (Balance Sheet)  \n- 3xxx = Equity (Balance Sheet)\n- 4xxx = Revenue (Income Statement)\n- 5xxx = Operating Expenses (Income Statement)\n- 6xxx = Other Income/Expense (Income Statement)\n\n## Hierarchy Structure\n\nChart of Accounts (COA) fields:\n- _member_name: Account number (e.g., \"4000\") or category name (e.g., \"Revenue\")\n- _member_alias: Account description\n- _parent_name: Immediate parent category\n- _operator: \"+\" or \"-\" for normal balance direction\n\nHierarchy levels:\n1. Root: \"Chart of Accounts\"\n2. Sections: \"Balance Sheet\", \"Net Income\"\n3. Categories: \"Revenue\", \"Expenses\", \"Other Income & Expense\"\n4. Sub-categories: \"Ticket Revenue\", \"Player Salaries\", etc.\n5. Leaf accounts: Numeric codes (4000, 5050, etc.)\n\n## Revenue Sub-Categories (_parent_name values)\n'Ticket Revenue', 'Sponsorship Revenue', 'Food & Beverage Revenue', 'Merchandise Revenue', 'Parking Revenue', 'Broadcast Revenue', 'Nfl Revenue', 'Event Revenue', 'Cheerleaders Revenue', 'Other Revenue', 'Foundation Contributions'\n\n## Expense Sub-Categories (_parent_name values)\n'Player Salaries', 'Full Time & Part Time Salaries', 'Benefits', 'Travel & Entertainment', 'Supplies & Services', 'Football Ops Expenses', 'Stadium & Facilities', 'Sales & Marketing', 'Foundation', 'Taxes & Insurance', 'League Assessments', 'Other Expense', 'Other Income', 'Depreciation Expense', 'Amortization Expense'\n\n## Other Income/Expense Sub-Categories\n'Net Interest', 'Gain/Loss On Sale'\n\n## SQL Query Patterns\n\n**Simplest (Recommended)** - Use account ranges:\n```sql\nWHERE _Account_Number BETWEEN '4000' AND '4999'  -- Revenue\nWHERE _Account_Number BETWEEN '5000' AND '5999'  -- Expenses\nWHERE _Account_Number BETWEEN '6000' AND '6999'  -- Other Income/Expense\n```\n\n**By Parent Name** - Join to COA:\n```sql\nJOIN chart_of_accounts coa ON t._Account_Number = coa._member_name\nWHERE coa._parent_name IN ('Ticket Revenue', 'Sponsorship Revenue', ...)\n```\n\n**Key Rules**:\n- Only leaf accounts (numeric _member_name) appear in transactions\n- Net Income = Revenue (4xxx) - Expenses (5xxx) + Other (6xxx)\n- Contra accounts have \"(Contra)\" in _member_alias\n- Allocation accounts end in x99 (5049, 5069, 5199, etc.)\n\n## Data Files\n1. Chart of Accounts: Hierarchy and account definitions\n2. Trial Balance: Period balances by account\n3. Transactions: Detail with _Account_Number, _Date, _Amount, _Period, _Department, _Event, _Activity\n\n## Net Income Calculation\n```sql\nSUM(CASE \n    WHEN _Account_Number BETWEEN '4000' AND '4999' THEN _Amount\n    WHEN _Account_Number BETWEEN '5000' AND '5999' THEN -_Amount\n    WHEN _Account_Number BETWEEN '6000' AND '6999' THEN _Amount\n    ELSE 0 \nEND) AS net_income\n```"},
