		{"id":"b2b51dc48794dba4","x":1500,"y":-800,"width":560,"height":440,"type":"text","text":"1. What are the inputs for ontology creation\n\t1. At present contexts are: business context, industry type\n\t2. Implementation:  fp&a standarad concepts.\n\t3. At present in output: Entities, relationships, hirerachies, business concepts, conception interaction flow. \n\t4. Implementation: dq_rules\n2. We do need to create new for ontology.\n\t1. do we need to create only one document? As per current design \n\t2. Do we need to create separate ontology documents for every table/column??\n\t3. ontology_concept schema is not clarified? how do we generate them?\n"},
