		{"id":"56e8dec625281450","x":847,"y":150,"width":593,"height":260,"type":"text","text":"Questions:\n1. Removing ontology from business context and making separate collection for it\n2. only 1 ontology for entire dq generation. \n3. Do we need to create one ontology for one table metadata. \n4. what all context do we need to pass on while generating the ontology?\n5. table binding... for that do we need to store that RAG result in collection?? or just we use it for sql generation??? \n"}
